    summary: ["OOP code ko objects ke gird munazzam karta hai, jin mein data aur actions ek saath rehte hain.", "Class ek blueprint hai aur object us se banayi gayi ek cheez hai.", "Methods class ke andar likhe gaye functions hain, aur self us object ki taraf ishara karta hai.", "Ek class kai objects bana sakti hai, jo ek doosre se aazaad hote hain."],
    practice: ["Cat naam ki ek class banayein jis mein meow naam ka method ho jo Meow! print kare. Phir ek object banayein aur method ko call karein.", "Book naam ki ek class banayein jis mein read naam ka method ho jo Reading a book print kare. Do objects banayein aur dono par read call karein.", "Car naam ki ek class banayein jis mein start naam ka method ho jo The car has started print kare. Ek object banayein aur start call karein."],
