      7: { items: ["Attributes woh variables hain jo ek object se talluq rakhte hain.", "Attribute ko dot se parhein ya set karein: object.attribute.", "Methods self ke zariye object ke apne attributes tak pohanchte hain.", "Ek hi class se banaye gaye objects apna data alag rakhte hain."] },
      8: { text: "Object banane ke baad attributes ek ek kar ke set karna kaam karta hai, lekin is mein ek attribute bhool jana aasan hai. Agla tutorial constructors ke baare mein hai, jo data usi waqt set kar dete hain jab object banaya jata hai." },
      9: { text: "Jab aap ko yaqeen na ho ke koi cheez kya hai, to type(object) istemal karein. Ye us class ko print karta hai jis se object banaya gaya tha, jo debugging ke waqt kaam aata hai." },
