      3: { items: ["Object banate waqt data store karne ke liye self, title, author, aur pages ke saath __init__ istemal karein.", "describe ke andar object ke apne data tak pohanchne ke liye self.title, self.author, aur self.pages istemal karein.", "f\"{self.title} by {self.author}, {self.pages} pages\" jaisi f-string se line ek hi step mein ban jati hai."] },
