      7: { text: "Yehi class kitni bhi kitaabon ke liye kaam karti hai. Objects ko ek list mein daalein aur un sab ko describe karne ke liye loop chalayein, aur len se pata chalta hai ke aap ke paas kitni kitaabein hain." },
