    summary: ["Class ek cheez ka data aur us data ko istemal karne wale methods ko ek saath rakhti hai.", "__init__ object banne par data store karta hai.", "Methods self ke zariye object ke apne attributes tak pohanchte hain.", "Ek class kai objects bana sakti hai, jin mein se har ek ka apna data hota hai."],
    practice: ["Book class mein is_long naam ka method shamil karein jo True return kare jab kitaab ke pages 300 se zyada hon, aur dono kitaabon par is ki test karein.", "Teesra Book object banayein aur teenon kitaabon ko ek list mein daalein, phir us kitaab ka title print karein jis ke pages sab se zyada hon.", "Movie naam ki ek class banayein jis mein title, director, aur year hon, aur describe method bhi ho, aur do movie objects banayein."],
