    summary: ["self method ko object ke apne data tak rasai deta hai.", "Constructor mein values ko self.length aur self.width ke tor par store karein.", "Methods un values ko self ke zariye wapas parhte hain.", "Har object apna data khud rakhta hai, is liye yehi method har rectangle ke liye kaam karta hai."],
    practice: ["Rectangle class mein is_square naam ka method shamil karein jo True return kare jab length aur width barabar hon.", "Circle naam ki ek class banayein jis mein radius attribute ho aur methods hon jo 3.14 istemal kar ke area aur circumference return karein.", "Do Rectangle objects banayein, ek ki length badlein, aur check karein ke doosre ka area tabdeel na hua ho."],
