      9: { text: "fahrenheit property ka koi setter nahi hai, is liye t.fahrenheit = 100 likhne par AttributeError milta hai. Isi mein is ka matlab hai: Fahrenheit Celsius se nikala jata hai, is liye use kabhi khud se set nahi karna chahiye." },
