    summary: ["@property method ko getter bana deta hai jo har read par chalta hai.", "Setter nayi value check kar sakta hai aur ghalat hone par use mana kar sakta hai.", "Computed property apni value har baar parhe jane par doosre data se nikalti hai.", "Bina setter wali property read-only hoti hai."],
    practice: ["Temperature class mein kelvin property shamil karein jo celsius plus 273.15 return kare, read-only property ke tor par.", "BankAccount naam ki ek class banayein jis mein balance property ho jis ka setter negative values ko mana kare.", "Rectangle naam ki ek class banayein jis mein read-only area property ho aur width ke liye setter ho jo zero ya negative values ko mana kare."],
